each deployment host. These artifacts are separate from the Apache-licensed
application source in this repository.

HTDemucs weights (htdemucs.pth)
  Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates (Demucs project)
  Used under the Demucs/MIT ecosystem; see Demucs repository for terms.

Ultimate Vocal Remover (UVR) MDX / MDX-Net ONNX and related checkpoints
